<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Final lockup (style-guide colours) — Jorgensen Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* EXACT style-guide tokens */
  :root{
    --ink:#302C2E;      /* Midnight — mark/wordmark on white */
    --body:#53534C;     /* Stone — subordinate text (EST.) */
    --surface:#DEDCD5;  /* Oyster — hairlines/rules ONLY */
    --ground:#ffffff;   /* White — page background */
    --cream:#f4efe4;    /* Cream — text over the dark hero ONLY */
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
  body{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--ground);color:var(--ink)}
  .serif{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif}
  .head{padding:2rem 3rem 1.2rem;background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream)}
  .head h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .head p{font-size:.76rem;color:#b9b4ad;margin-top:.4rem;max-width:64ch;line-height:1.6}
  h2.sec{font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--body);margin:0;padding:1.5rem 3rem .3rem;font-weight:700}

  .lockup{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .lockup .mono{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.06em}
  .lockup .word{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-top:.42em}
  .lockup .rule{height:1px;margin:.42em 0}
  .lockup .sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.5em;padding-left:.5em}
  .lockup .est{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.4em;padding-left:.4em;margin-top:.7em}

  .stage{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--surface)}
  .stage > div{flex:1 1 360px;min-height:360px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:3rem}
  .on-white{background:var(--ground)}
  .on-hero{background:#16171b;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(9,10,13,.55),rgba(9,10,13,.82)),radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#2c2f38,#16171b)}
  .note{font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--body);padding:.2rem 3rem 0}
  .note.dim{color:#8a857f}

  .navbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1.1rem 2.2rem;width:100%}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.7rem;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .nav-compact{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem}
  .nav-compact .nm{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.08rem;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1}
  .nav-compact .nw{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:.86rem;letter-spacing:.34em;line-height:1}
  .nav-div{width:1px;height:20px;background:var(--surface)}

  .favs{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1.8rem;padding:1.6rem 3rem 3rem}
  .favtile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
  .favtile .t{font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--body)}
  .sq{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .sq .serif{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="head">
  <h1>Final lockup — corrected to style-guide colours</h1>
  <p>Midnight / Stone / Oyster <em>on white</em>. Mark + wordmark in Ink #302C2E; hairline rule in Oyster #DEDCD5 (rules only, never a fill); EST. 2026 in Stone #53534C. Cream #f4efe4 used only for the version that sits over the dark homepage hero.</p>
</div>

<!-- FULL STACKED LOCKUP -->
<h2 class="sec">Full stacked lockup</h2>
<p class="note">on white ground · Ink mark · Oyster hairline · Stone EST.</p>
<div class="stage">
  <div class="on-white">
    <div class="lockup">
      <span class="mono" style="font-size:3.4rem;color:var(--ink)">JF</span>
      <span class="word" style="font-size:2.5rem;color:var(--ink)">JORGENSEN</span>
      <span class="rule" style="width:248px;background:var(--surface)"></span>
      <span class="sub" style="font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink)">FOUNDATION</span>
      <span class="est" style="font-size:.6rem;color:var(--body)">EST. 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="on-hero">
    <div class="lockup">
      <span class="mono" style="font-size:3.4rem;color:var(--cream)">JF</span>
      <span class="word" style="font-size:2.5rem;color:var(--cream)">JORGENSEN</span>
      <span class="rule" style="width:248px;background:var(--cream);opacity:.5"></span>
      <span class="sub" style="font-size:.82rem;color:var(--cream)">FOUNDATION</span>
      <span class="est" style="font-size:.6rem;color:var(--cream);opacity:.72">EST. 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="note dim" style="padding-top:.6rem">left: white ground (inner pages, footer) · right: over the dark homepage hero (cream)</p>

<!-- NAV CUTS -->
<h2 class="sec">Compact nav cut — full</h2>
<p class="note">scrolled white nav = Ink · transparent over-hero nav = Cream (per guide)</p>
<div class="stage">
  <div class="on-white" style="min-height:150px;align-items:stretch;padding:0">
    <div class="navbar" style="color:var(--ink)">
      <div class="nav-compact">
        <span class="nm">JF</span><span class="nav-div"></span>
        <span class="nw">JORGENSEN&nbsp;FOUNDATION</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links serif" style="font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--ink)"><span>PROGRAMS</span><span>ABOUT</span><span>PUBLICATIONS</span><span>CONTACT</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="on-hero" style="min-height:150px;align-items:stretch;padding:0">
    <div class="navbar" style="color:var(--cream)">
      <div class="nav-compact">
        <span class="nm">JF</span><span class="nav-div" style="background:var(--cream);opacity:.4"></span>
        <span class="nw">JORGENSEN&nbsp;FOUNDATION</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links serif" style="font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--cream)"><span>PROGRAMS</span><span>ABOUT</span><span>PUBLICATIONS</span><span>CONTACT</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="sec">Compact nav cut — monogram-led alternative</h2>
<div class="stage">
  <div class="on-white" style="min-height:130px;align-items:stretch;padding:0">
    <div class="navbar" style="color:var(--ink)">
      <div class="nav-compact"><span class="nm" style="font-size:1.25rem">JF</span><span class="nw" style="letter-spacing:.3em">JORGENSEN</span></div>
      <div class="nav-links serif" style="font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--ink)"><span>PROGRAMS</span><span>ABOUT</span><span>PUBLICATIONS</span><span>CONTACT</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="on-hero" style="min-height:130px;align-items:stretch;padding:0">
    <div class="navbar" style="color:var(--cream)">
      <div class="nav-compact"><span class="nm" style="font-size:1.25rem">JF</span><span class="nw" style="letter-spacing:.3em">JORGENSEN</span></div>
      <div class="nav-links serif" style="font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--cream)"><span>PROGRAMS</span><span>ABOUT</span><span>PUBLICATIONS</span><span>CONTACT</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FAVICONS -->
<h2 class="sec">Favicon / app mark</h2>
<div class="favs">
  <div class="favtile"><div class="sq" style="width:64px;height:64px;background:var(--ink)"><span class="serif" style="color:var(--cream);font-size:42px">JF</span></div><span class="t">midnight tile · 64</span></div>
  <div class="favtile"><div class="sq" style="width:32px;height:32px;background:var(--ink)"><span class="serif" style="color:var(--cream);font-size:22px">JF</span></div><span class="t">32</span></div>
  <div class="favtile"><div class="sq" style="width:16px;height:16px;background:var(--ink)"><span class="serif" style="color:var(--cream);font-size:12px">JF</span></div><span class="t">16</span></div>
  <div class="favtile"><div class="sq" style="width:64px;height:64px;background:var(--ground);border:1px solid var(--surface)"><span class="serif" style="color:var(--ink);font-size:42px">JF</span></div><span class="t">bare ink on white</span></div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
